Python / Django

===================================================================

Virtual Environment

This is the most important one! Never share your 'venv'.

venv/
/venv/

Python cache files

pycache/
*.pyc

Local development database

db.sqlite3
db.sqlite3-journal

Environment variables

Contains secret keys (like your Google API key, database password)

.env
.env.*
*.env

User-uploaded files

You generally don't track user-uploaded media in Git

/media/

Collected static files for production

/static/

AI Models (if you save them locally)

*.joblib
*.pth

